<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of May 9, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						May 9    WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  2,626  2,625   4,890</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 98    116	99</p>
<p>CCC					    1,277  1,240   1,303</p>
<p>TOTAL					  4,001  3,981   6,292</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				    723    697   3,009</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				203    199   1,293</p>
<p>CCC					    3,108  3,108   1,958</p>
<p>TOTAL					  4,034  4,004   6,260</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
